OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of shoplifting cases
OL,4,Alinked to 40 suspects
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust 40 prolific shoplifting suspects
OL,7,Fwere linked to at least 5,000 offences
OL,8,Fin north-east England and Cumbria over
OL,9,Fthe past five years.
OL,11,FFigures obtained by the BBC's Data Unit
OL,12,Falso found shoplifting offences rose by
OL,13,Fmore than three-quarters over the past
OL,14,Fdecade, with Cleveland seeing the
OL,15,Fbiggest yearly percentage rise across
OL,16,FEngland and Wales between 2025-26.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
