OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of shoplifting cases
OL,4,Alinked to 40 suspects
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile in Cumbria last year most of the
OL,7,Ftop suspects ended up being summoned to
OL,8,Fcourt or charged, more than half of
OL,9,Fcases in the Northumbria and Cleveland
OL,10,Fforce areas were completed with no
OL,11,Fsuspect found.
OL,13,FThe Home Office said retail crime had
OL,14,Fbeen dismissed as low-level offending
OL,15,F"for too long" and charges were up
OL,16,Fnationally by 19%.
